D. THE ARCHITECTURE TESTS — infrastructure, then three checks
====================================================================

`Directory.Build.props:84` wires AgentGuard's analyzers only where `AgentGuardIsAnalyzerProject != 'true'`, and `AgentGuard.Analyzers.csproj` sets it true — confirmed live — so a Roslyn analyzer policing the analyzer project would never run. Enforcement is a test.

